OL,3,CJimmy Anderson's time at Lancashire
OL,4,C'comes to an end'
OL,6,FEngland's all-time record wicket-taker
OL,7,FSir James Anderson has expressed
OL,8,Fregret at how his 25-year spell with
OL,9,FLancashire has come to an end after
OL,10,Fthe club confirmed he will not be
OL,11,Foffered a new contract.
OL,13,FAnderson will leave his boyhood county
OL,14,Fhaving taken 443 wickets in 112 First-
OL,15,FClass appearances since making his
OL,16,Fdebut in 2001.
OL,18,FA few minutes before Lancashire made
OL,19,Ftheir decision public in a statement,
OL,20,FAnderson used Instagram to make clear
OL,21,Fhis own feelings.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
