PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1792937943
OL,3,CJimmy Anderson's time at Lancashire
OL,4,C'comes to an end'
OL,6,F"I've supported Lancashire since I was
OL,7,Fkid, and so to get to play for them
OL,8,Ffor 25 years was a dream come true,"
OL,9,FAnderson wrote.
OL,11,F"I have always found it special
OL,12,Fwalking out to play at Old Trafford
OL,13,Fand have some incredible memories of
OL,14,Fdoing so including the honour of being
OL,15,Fcaptain ` if it was up to me it
OL,16,Fwouldn't have ended like this, but I
OL,17,Fwish the players and fans all the best
OL,18,Ffor the future."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@dO]sD@AOUzD@PO]
