OL,3,CJimmy Anderson's time at Lancashire
OL,4,C'comes to an end'
OL,6,FAnderson had continued to play for
OL,7,FLancashire after his England career
OL,8,Fcame to an end in July 2024, and last
OL,9,Fyear took the captaincy at Old
OL,10,FTrafford, where he has an end named
OL,11,Fafter him.
OL,13,FLancashire's decision to move on from
OL,14,FAnderson comes after the recent
OL,15,Fappointments of chief executive
OL,16,FRichard Kenyon and director of cricket
OL,17,FPaul Farbrace, tasked with rebuilding
OL,18,Fthe club after they finished second
OL,19,Fbottom of County Championship Division
OL,20,FTwo having been strong favourites for
OL,21,Fpromotion.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
