PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1792937943
OL,3,CJimmy Anderson's time at Lancashire
OL,4,C'comes to an end'
OL,6,FIn a statement, Farbrace said he and
OL,7,FKenyon met with Anderson on October 19
OL,8,Fto inform him of their decision.
OL,10,F"Jimmy is without doubt the greatest
OL,11,Fbowler Lancashire and England have
OL,12,Fproduced," Farbrace said. "He has been
OL,13,Fa fantastic competitor throughout his
OL,14,Fcareer, with exceptional skill and an
OL,15,Funwavering commitment to setting the
OL,16,Fhighest standards in every dressing
OL,17,Froom he has been part of...
OL,19,F"I would like to thank Jimmy for
OL,20,Feverything he has given to Lancashire
OL,21,FCricket over the course of his career.
OL,26,@rD@AOUtD@JO]tD@[OU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
