PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1792937943
OL,3,CJimmy Anderson's time at Lancashire
OL,4,C'comes to an end'
OL,6,F"His contribution to the club has been
OL,7,Fimmense, both on and off the field,
OL,8,Fand he leaves a lasting legacy. We
OL,9,Fhave enormous respect for what he has
OL,10,Fachieved, and we will always be proud
OL,11,Fthat he has represented Lancashire for
OL,12,Fso many years."
OL,14,FIt remains to be seen whether Anderson
OL,15,Fwill elect to retire, or continue a
OL,16,Fcareer in which he took 704 wickets in
OL,17,F188 Tests, a record for a non-spinner.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@OO]
